

<ul>
  <li>Any resource type <em class="rfc">may</em> have the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">requiredStatement</code> property.<br />
Clients <em class="rfc">must</em> render <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">requiredStatement</code> on every resource type.</li>
</ul>

